<title>USA: Akorn names Rita McConville CFO. [CORRECTED 17:55 GMT]</title>
<headline>Akorn names Rita McConville CFO. [CORRECTED 17:55 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>ABTA SPRINGS, La. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Akorn Inc said Wednesday it had named Rita McConville vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>(Corrects title from COO to CFO).</p>
<p>She succeeds Eric Wingerter, who is leaving to pursue other interests, said the company.</p>
<p>McConville was formerly senior director and comptroller at Option Care Inc, a home health care company.</p>
<p>Akorn manufactures sterile ophthalmic and injectible pharmaceuticals and distributes a line of ophthalmic products.</p>
